---
// DeepSeek 三件套协同：MoE 省 FFN 计算 + MLA 省注意力 KV Cache + FP8 训练/量化
---
<figure>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 600 320" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <defs>
      <filter id="ds-shadow" x="-20%" y="-20%" width="140%" height="160%">
        <feDropShadow dx="0" dy="2" stdDeviation="4" flood-color="#0b2a3a" flood-opacity="0.10"></feDropShadow>
      </filter>
    </defs>
    <g font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif" text-anchor="middle">
      <text x="300" y="26" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" fill="#0c5f74">DeepSeek 降低大模型成本的“三件套”</text>

      <!-- MoE -->
      <rect x="36" y="54" width="168" height="110" rx="12" fill="#f0fbf5" stroke="#0f9d68" stroke-width="1.6" filter="url(#ds-shadow)"></rect>
      <text x="120" y="82" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#0a7a50">MoE</text>
      <text x="120" y="104" font-size="10.5" fill="#3f8065">稀疏专家：每 token 只</text>
      <text x="120" y="120" font-size="10.5" fill="#3f8065">激活 37B / 总 671B</text>
      <text x="120" y="144" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#0a7a50">省：FFN 计算量（FLOPs）</text>

      <!-- MLA -->
      <rect x="216" y="54" width="168" height="110" rx="12" fill="#f0f9fc" stroke="#0e87a6" stroke-width="1.6" filter="url(#ds-shadow)"></rect>
      <text x="300" y="82" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#0a5f78">MLA 注意力</text>
      <text x="300" y="104" font-size="10.5" fill="#4a7284">K/V 压成低维潜向量缓存</text>
      <text x="300" y="120" font-size="10.5" fill="#4a7284">（详见注意力演进篇）</text>
      <text x="300" y="144" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#0a5f78">省：注意力 KV Cache</text>

      <!-- FP8 -->
      <rect x="396" y="54" width="168" height="110" rx="12" fill="#fdf3ec" stroke="#e6a23c" stroke-width="1.6" filter="url(#ds-shadow)"></rect>
      <text x="480" y="82" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#b5791f">FP8 训练</text>
      <text x="480" y="104" font-size="10.5" fill="#9a7440">权重/激活用 8-bit 浮点</text>
      <text x="480" y="120" font-size="10.5" fill="#9a7440">Hopper GPU 原生高吞吐</text>
      <text x="480" y="144" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#b5791f">省：训练算力 + 显存带宽</text>

      <!-- 目标 -->
      <line x1="120" y1="164" x2="220" y2="216" stroke="#cbd5e1" stroke-width="1.5"></line>
      <line x1="300" y1="164" x2="300" y2="216" stroke="#cbd5e1" stroke-width="1.5"></line>
      <line x1="480" y1="164" x2="380" y2="216" stroke="#cbd5e1" stroke-width="1.5"></line>
      <rect x="150" y="220" width="300" height="66" rx="12" fill="#0e87a6" filter="url(#ds-shadow)"></rect>
      <text x="300" y="248" font-size="13" font-weight="bold" fill="#fff">671B 超大模型</text>
      <text x="300" y="270" font-size="11" fill="#dff3f9">训练/推理成本可控、消费级硬件也能体验</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
</figure>
